    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">VDP301 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">VDP301 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Video Production Handbook</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Gerald Millerson and Jim Owens · Focal Press · 2008 · Fourth Edition · ISBN <code>ASIN:B00DT6B8PI</code></p><p>Link: <a href=\"https://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=32249\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=32249</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Filmmaking in Action</strong></p><p>Adam Leipzig, Barry Weiss, Michael Goldman · Bedford/St. Martin's · 2015 · First Edition · ISBN <code>978-0312616991</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>In the Blink of an Eye: A Perspective on Film Editing</strong></p><p>Walter Murch · Silman-James Press · 2001 · Second Edition · ISBN <code>978-1879505629</code></p></div>"
